        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hydrogen, gaseous, 700 bar, from electrolysis, from label-certified electricity, at fuelling station</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hydrogen, gaseous, 700 bar, from electrolysis, from label-certified electricity, at fuelling station
 Hydrogen compressed from 25 bar to 700 bar. Electricity for compression: 3.2 kWh/kg H2 @ 700 bar, according to U.S. Department of Energy 2009 (https://www.hydrogen.energy.gov/pdfs/9013_energy_requirements_for_hydrogen_gas_compression.pdf). Includes 250 km of high-pressure truck transport to fuelling station. Includes 2% loss from the H2 plant to the vehicle tank. Original source: Antonini et al. 2020, Hydrogen production from natural gas and biomethane with carbon capture and storage ï¿½ A techno-environmental analysis, doi: 10.1039/D0SE00222D. UUID: a7f0e28f-4316-3af0-923e-405fb4663681
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Hydrogen compressed from 25 bar to 700 bar. Electricity for compression: 3.2 kWh/kg H2 @ 700 bar, according to U.S. Department of Energy 2009 (https://www.hydrogen.energy.gov/pdfs/9013_energy_requirements_for_hydrogen_gas_compression.pdf). Includes 250 km of high-pressure truck transport to fuelling station. Includes 2% loss from the H2 plant to the vehicle tank. Original source: Antonini et al. 2020, Hydrogen production from natural gas and biomethane with carbon capture and storage ï¿½ A techno-environmental analysis, doi: 10.1039/D0SE00222D
Time period: Base technology year of 2020
Production volume: Unspecified
Sampling: Unspecified
Extrapolations: Unspecified
Uncertainty adjustments: Unspecified
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a7f0e28f-4316-3af0-923e-405fb4663681.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
